[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0020","text":"（嘻嘻……窝在沙发上，懒懒散散……\n　这才叫，假日……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0030","text":"──甜花酱～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0040","text":"篮子里的东西我要拿去洗了\n还有别的想洗的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0050","text":"啊——……！\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0060","text":"──没有……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0070","text":"好～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0080","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0090","text":"（小熊先生，被果汁……\n　弄脏了……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21500100_01_0100","text":"（算了吧……\n　用纸巾擦擦就好了……！）"}]
